 ### Incorporation standing
 
 Accepted parent DRP semantics, incorporated under the operative Task for 1.1.23/001. Actual resulting candidate confirmation remains pending. Earlier component/source qualifications remain independently in force.
+
+### Final.002 operational allocation and compatibility
+
+Mneme operational revision, Active Generation/cache-working facts and Mneme–Mnemosyne
+handshake observations are associated **peer OperationalMetadata**, scoped to the
+IU, manifestation or operation as appropriate. Their semantic home does not remove
+the existing ManagementContext/LifecycleContext projections, stale-write/concurrency
+checks, visibility, recovery, work preservation, retention or causal/evidence facts
+required by any of the **five existing logical contracts**. The precise association/
+projection layout remains bounded detailed design; no new façade field, service,
+schema or breaking removal is prescribed.
+
+The Mnemosyne-established authoritative persisted revision stays with the same IU;
+Summary and full access preserve that IU/version and accepted Themis/disclosure
+rules. Operational status cannot substitute for multi-site durable mutation Success,
+nor may a cache expiry discard required durable work or audit/provenance. MI-05
+continues to require **complete required coverage by the union of eligible available
+supported criteria**, not overlap or mere matching of the current request. Existing
+AV/FC/MI and MC-01–MC-07 qualifications remain unchanged; this allocation neither
+adds a sixth contract nor promotes cache state or operational observation to truth.
